---

<section class="section">
        <div class="section-gap">
          <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container">
            <div class="about-row svc-process">
              <div class="service-left svc-process">
                <div to-top-0="" class="section-badge">
                  <div class="pill-dot"></div>
                  <div class="badge-text">Our Process</div>
                </div>
                <div class="about-left svc-process">
                  <div class="section-header _w-w-work v2">
                    <div class="max-width-32">
                      <h2 class="section-heading">From complex questions to a clear path forward.</h2>
                    </div>
                    <p class="paragraph-regular">A focused process designed to replace uncertainty with direction.</p>
                  </div>
                  <div to-top-4="">
                    <a data-wf--primary-button--variant="bg-white" data-wf-component-id="4c762986-7cae-1c12-bec9-1ecbb760ee61" data-wf-variant-state="21f200ea-2927-6f93-7fe0-867acd69adf4" href="/contact-v1" class="primary-button w-variant-21f200ea-2927-6f93-7fe0-867acd69adf4 w-inline-block">
                      <div class="button-text-pill">
                        <div class="button-text is-one">Start a Project</div>
                        <div class="button-text is-two">Start a Project</div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="button-arrow-pill"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="button-arrow">
                          <path d="M15.8333 12.5002H9.99992H3.33325L3.33325 5.8335V5.3335" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                          <path d="M12.5 16.6668L16.6667 12.5002L12.5 8.3335" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                        </svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="button-arrow">
                          <path d="M15.8333 12.5002H9.99992H3.33325L3.33325 5.8335V5.3335" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                          <path d="M12.5 16.6668L16.6667 12.5002L12.5 8.3335" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                        </svg></div>
                    </a>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="how-we-work-steps svc-process">
                <div to-top-0="" class="how-we-work-card svc-process">
                  <div class="how-we-work-image-wrap svc-process"><img class="how-we-work-image svc-process" src="/images/Rectangle-16-3.webp" alt="Team working around a white meeting table with a laptop, tablet and coffee mug" sizes="100vw" parallax="" loading="lazy" srcset="/images/Rectangle-16-3-p-500.webp 500w, /images/Rectangle-16-3-p-800.webp 800w, /images/Rectangle-16-3-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/Rectangle-16-3.webp 1384w"></div>
                  <div class="how-we-work-content svc-process">
                    <div class="badge-text">01. Discover</div>
                    <div class="card-bottom-info">
                      <h3 class="font-medium">Understand the challenge.</h3>
                      <p class="paragraph-regular">We investigate the business context, technical constraints, users, systems, and opportunities.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-0="" class="how-we-work-card svc-process">
                  <div class="how-we-work-image-wrap svc-process"><img class="how-we-work-image svc-process" src="/images/Rectangle-16-4.webp" alt="Woman in a white coat walking down a bright laboratory corridor" sizes="100vw" parallax="" loading="lazy" srcset="/images/Rectangle-16-4-p-500.webp 500w, /images/Rectangle-16-4-p-800.webp 800w, /images/Rectangle-16-4-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/Rectangle-16-4.webp 1384w"></div>
                  <div class="how-we-work-content svc-process">
                    <div class="badge-text">02. Define</div>
                    <div class="card-bottom-info">
                      <h3 class="font-medium">Find the right direction.</h3>
                      <p class="paragraph-regular">We turn complexity into clear priorities, technical direction, and an actionable strategy.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-0="" class="how-we-work-card svc-process">
                  <div class="how-we-work-image-wrap svc-process"><img class="how-we-work-image svc-process" src="/images/9a3ae1981f22af98fd4e989517f733ee02952925.webp" alt="Engineers typing on laptops around a dark table during a development session" sizes="100vw" parallax="" loading="lazy" srcset="/images/9a3ae1981f22af98fd4e989517f733ee02952925-p-500.webp 500w, /images/9a3ae1981f22af98fd4e989517f733ee02952925-p-800.webp 800w, /images/9a3ae1981f22af98fd4e989517f733ee02952925-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/9a3ae1981f22af98fd4e989517f733ee02952925-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/9a3ae1981f22af98fd4e989517f733ee02952925-p-2000.webp 2000w, /images/9a3ae1981f22af98fd4e989517f733ee02952925.webp 2378w"></div>
                  <div class="how-we-work-content svc-process">
                    <div class="badge-text">03. Build</div>
                    <div class="card-bottom-info">
                      <h3 class="font-medium">Turn ideas into reality.</h3>
                      <p class="paragraph-regular">We design, engineer, prototype, and develop solutions built around real-world requirements.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div to-top-0="" class="how-we-work-card svc-process">
                  <div class="how-we-work-image-wrap svc-process"><img class="how-we-work-image svc-process" src="/images/4312d9fe2c654f67c9b559f862f20b0d50890380.webp" alt="Man in a cap reviewing work at a laptop beside a colleague taking notes" sizes="100vw" parallax="" loading="lazy" srcset="/images/4312d9fe2c654f67c9b559f862f20b0d50890380-p-500.webp 500w, /images/4312d9fe2c654f67c9b559f862f20b0d50890380-p-800.webp 800w, /images/4312d9fe2c654f67c9b559f862f20b0d50890380-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/4312d9fe2c654f67c9b559f862f20b0d50890380-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/4312d9fe2c654f67c9b559f862f20b0d50890380-p-2000.webp 2000w, /images/4312d9fe2c654f67c9b559f862f20b0d50890380.webp 2400w"></div>
                  <div class="how-we-work-content svc-process">
                    <div class="badge-text">04. Optimize</div>
                    <div class="card-bottom-info">
                      <h3 class="font-medium">Make it better.</h3>
                      <p class="paragraph-regular">We measure performance, refine systems, and prepare solutions for long-term growth.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
